==Trivia==
*A Cat Screaming Love's name comes from ''[[wikipedia:The Beast that Shouted Love at the Heart of the World (short story)|The Beast that Shouted Love at the Heart of the World]]'', a story by Harlan Ellison, and—more relevantly—the title of [https://wiki.evageeks.org/Episode_26 Episode 26] of ''[[wikipedia:Neon Genesis Evangelion|Neon Genesis Evangelion]]'' (from which Cruel Angel Clionel gets her inspiration).

